      "code": "if (!parse_host (p, hostend - p, flags, host, error))",
      "note": "After cleanup, the authority parser hands the cleaned bracketed host `[:%20<0xF8>]` to `parse_host()`. The saved vulnerable run proves this call returned success and later produced the host string reserialized by `g_uri_to_string()`.",
